WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,800
In broad daylight, you are not afraid of being seen

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,720
I came out to dig wild vegetables and asked you by the way.

3
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:10,320
Teacher Jiang said that the sky is going to change. Is it true or false?

4
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,560
It may rain tonight tonight or it may rain tomorrow morning.

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,790
Then I have to tell Xiao Tang to raise the sketch

6
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:16,270
Don't let Su Weiwei know it was me who said that

7
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:18,070
Don't worry about other people.

8
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,510
How long will you have enough firewood in your cave?

9
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:21,190
Half a month. Why are you afraid that I will be hungry?

10
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:23,310
I'm afraid you'll starve to death and no one will take care of our food.

11
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:26,490
Don't worry, wait until the rain stops

12
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,280
You have to come and beg me

13
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:39,910
Wait, it's for Shen Xiaotang.

14
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:41,610
Don't say I gave it to you

15
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:46,460
You still miss her a lot

16
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:48,150
She was sick while working and skipping the show
